{"id":29965,"slug":"targets","title":"Targets","year":1968,"country":"United States","duration":90,"spine":1179,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/29965-targets","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/e2297564f171331395684adc96189e04/yjQWxtmqotkr5GmtEwbWdudO6KUyiA_large.jpg","description":"Old Hollywood collides with New Hollywood, and screen horror with real-life horror, in the startling debut feature from Peter Bogdanovich. Produced by Roger Corman, this chillingly prescient vision of American-made carnage casts Boris Karloff as a version of himself: an aging horror-movie icon whose fate intersects with that of a seemingly ordinary young man (Tim O’Kelly) on a psychotic shooting spree around Los Angeles. Charged with provocative ideas about the relationship between mass media and mass violence, Targets is a model of maximally effective filmmaking on a minimal budget and a potent first statement from one of the defining voices of the American New Wave.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Peter Bogdanovich","slug":"peter-bogdanovich"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Boris Karloff","role":"Byron Orlok","slug":"boris-karloff"},{"actor":"Tim O’Kelly","role":"Bobby Thompson","slug":"tim-okelly"},{"actor":"Nancy Hsueh","role":"Jenny","slug":"nancy-hsueh"},{"actor":"Peter Bogdanovich","role":"Sammy Michaels","slug":"peter-bogdanovich"},{"actor":"James Brown","role":"Robert Thompson Sr.","slug":"james-brown"},{"actor":"Arthur Peterson","role":"Ed Loughlin","slug":"arthur-peterson"},{"actor":"Mary Jackson","role":"Charlotte Thompson","slug":"mary-jackson"},{"actor":"Tanya Morgan","role":"Ilene Thompson","slug":"tanya-morgan"},{"actor":"Sandy Baron","role":"Kip Larkin","slug":"sandy-baron"},{"actor":"Monty Landis","role":"Marshall Smith","slug":"monty-landis"},{"actor":"Paul Condylis","role":"Drive-in manager","slug":"paul-condylis"},{"actor":"Stafford Morgan","role":"Salesman (first gun shop)","slug":"stafford-morgan"},{"actor":"Mark Dennis","role":"S